sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Server
    participant E as ESP32
    participant A as STM32 App
    participant B as Bootloader
    S->>E: MQTT update notification
    E->>S: HTTPS manifest/artifact
    E->>A: HELLO / QUERY
    A-->>E: version, state, resume offset
    E->>A: START + DATA...
    A-->>E: ACK/NACK
    E->>A: FINISH / INSTALL
    A->>B: Reset
    B->>B: Verify, reconstruct, backup, install
    B->>A: Trial boot
    A->>B: Confirm application
